    "turn_text": "Great to have you. Thanks a lot for stopping by. Lots going on. Lots to get to. Lots to talk about. If you haven't seen Bill Clinton in a while, then look like his old self anymore. Now, listen, I realize it's been 30 years since he was elected president. But I remember this and they do this generally speaking with with those in the left like Obama when we're having dreams about being with Obama and and everybody and everybody wanted to be with Bill Clinton. Bill Clinton is is slimy. He is just a nasty guy. Now again his persona out in public use his sell you anything sell you the shirt on his back. But just not a good guy. I mean, from Epstein Island to all of the allegations against them, women who actually came out and said, and he couldn't deny it at the end, because he goes, hey, what about all the allegations against Trump? Well, none of those ever panned out. with Bill Clinton. I mean, you know this guy is no good. I'm not really sure what that marriage is, to be honest with you, because Hillary is no good either. And I'm not saying it just because I politically disagree with them. These just aren't good people. They're just generally speaking not. But Bill Clinton is just as good a liar today as he was back in the day. I mean, the guy can sit there, look you in the face. and just lie his ass off. And he's so good at it. And I can't remember who it was. It was somebody in Hollywood, Kerry, I love you remember this or not, but somebody in Hollywood, Hollywood producer, director, somebody who was a friend of the Clintons, who said, I have never seen people who lie so well.",
